{"_note":"详情页页头 v2(v40:圆角随全页收 14、右簇 4.9/评分数按 icon 竖直居中;v41 星标再上提 4pt 对齐数字的**墨迹**中心 —— 数字行盒下面带着 descender 空间,按行盒居中星标就低 4pt,2026-09-06 iPhone 真机实拍):icon + App 名 + 开发者·分类 + 年龄/价格 chip 行 + 右侧大评分(整页唯一源色结论数)+ 评分数 + 取数时刻。体积/最低 iOS/发版节奏挪去指标网格(d-metrics),本卡只管「这是谁」。字段读页面级 depends(page/flow/app.df)。 名称兜底:公开 lookup 在各地区都查不到时,「我的 App」用 App Store Connect 的名称(m-app.df 的 nm)。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"bg","type":"layer","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"{parent.h}","bgColor":"#FFFFFF|#15171A","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"14pt","leftB":"14pt","rightT":"14pt","rightB":"14pt"}},{"id":"icon","type":"img","x":"16pt","y":"16pt","w":"46pt","h":"46pt","url":"${icon}","scaleType":"centerCrop","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"12pt","leftB":"12pt","rightT":"12pt","rightB":"12pt"},"bgColor":"#E7E9EE|#20232A"},{"id":"name","type":"txt","x":"74pt","y":"16pt","w":"{parent.w}-176pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${name},findNotEmpty::(${nm},--))]","fontSize":"16.5pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"1"},{"id":"meta","type":"txt","x":"74pt","y":"40pt","w":"{parent.w}-176pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${seller},--)] · $[findNotEmpty::(${genre},--)]","fontSize":"10.5pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${isFree},0),1),1,0)]"},"react":[{"id":"chips","type":"txt","x":"74pt","y":"58pt","w":"{parent.w}-176pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${adv},--)] · ${@i18n.free} · ${@i18n.at} ${at}","fontSize":"10pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${isFree},0),1),0,1)]"},"react":[{"id":"chips","type":"txt","x":"74pt","y":"58pt","w":"{parent.w}-176pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${adv},--)] · ${price} · ${@i18n.at} ${at}","fontSize":"10pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]},{"id":"star","type":"path","x":"{parent.w}-70pt","y":"19pt","w":"15pt","h":"15pt","d":"M234.29,114.85l-45,38.83L203,211